# Belt-and-braces: the real Marathon 2 game data used for local web-port
# testing must live outside this repo (see CLAUDE.md / WEB_PORT_PLAN.md) and
# never be committed. These patterns guard against it accidentally ending up
# inside the tree.
/Marathon 2/
/web/testdata/
*.sceA
*.shpA
*.sndA
*.imgA
*.phyA
*.sgaA
*.filA

# JS/TS tooling under web/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/coverage/

# Compiled engine output (alephone.js/.wasm), produced locally by
# web/build-engine.sh -- large binary build output, not source. Deliberately
# not web/public/: Vite refuses to `import()` .js files that live under its
# publicDir, and MODULARIZE'd Emscripten output needs to be imported (see
# WEB_PORT_PLAN.md, M4), so this is its own plain static directory instead.
/web/engine/

# Out-of-tree Emscripten build directory (emconfigure/emmake), see
# WEB_PORT_PLAN.md M2/M3.
/build-wasm/
/build-wasm-gl/
